(corpus-ch4-058)
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *define integral qmin=-0.10
    if (dynprs > 100 || vel < 1000) {
      qmin = 0.0;
    } else {
      qmin = (100.0 - dynprs)^2;
    }
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when time>1 stop
*end
